  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup almond flour",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "3 tablespoon mozzarella liquid",
    "1 large egg",
    "1/4 cup parmesan cheese (shredded)",
    "2 tablespoon pesto",
    "2 tablespoon fresh basil",
    "1/2 ounce mozzarella pearls",
    "4 medium cherry tomatoes"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Heat oven to 375F and line a cookie sheet with parchment. Spray with non stick spray. Combine the almond flour, garlic powder, and mozzarella liquid in a bowl, then stir gently.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/tomato-basil-and-mozzarella-galette/#wprm-recipe-52361-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/tomato-basil-n-mozzarella-galette-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the egg and Parmesan cheese, then mix well until dough forms.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/tomato-basil-and-mozzarella-galette/#wprm-recipe-52361-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/tomato-basil-n-mozzarella-galette-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form the dough mixture into a large ball and place on the prepared parchment.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/tomato-basil-and-mozzarella-galette/#wprm-recipe-52361-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/tomato-basil-n-mozzarella-galette-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the dough ball into a circle, working to keep the thickness uniform. It should press out to about ½ inch thick. It may be sticky, so wetting your hands with a little water can help keep the dough from sticking to your fingers.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/tomato-basil-and-mozzarella-galette/#wprm-recipe-52361-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/tomato-basil-n-mozzarella-galette-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread pesto evenly over the center of the crust, leaving room to fold in the edges. Layer mozzarella, basil leaves, and tomatoes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/tomato-basil-and-mozzarella-galette/#wprm-recipe-52361-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/tomato-basil-n-mozzarella-galette-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the edge of the parchment, fold the edges of the crust up and over the filling. Work in a circle around the edge until all of the edges are folded up.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/tomato-basil-and-mozzarella-galette/#wprm-recipe-52361-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/tomato-basil-n-mozzarella-galette-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 20 to 25 minutes or until crust browns and cheese is melted.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/tomato-basil-and-mozzarella-galette/#wprm-recipe-52361-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
